<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 PET HOLOHOLO BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETELO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lûpapûlo Lûtangi Lusintilwe no Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">LÛPAPÛLO LÛTANGI LWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETELO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Lwimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nene Petelo, kikûla kya Yesû Kilisitu, na nimisintêla benywe basololwe no kabesha Mpûngû Tata kwana mwa sangalala no mwa gikana nagwe batini kûko kû Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia, no Bitinia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Kabesha Mpûngû Tata wimisolwele benywe kûlondana no kibalo kyage mulongilwe balûmbûlûke no Mutêma mumone kumukokela Yesû Kilisitu, no kumunkibwa no masi gage.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Nanimikebele kyabûntû no angalê.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkûdjagêlo lwê bûkome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Atûmbêkwe Kabesha Mpûngû Tata wa Kolo wetû Yesû Kilisitu! Kwa lûsa lwage lûkata wêtûlongile tûbyalwe kûya kwa kumusangûla Yesû Kilisitu kuima kûbaki. Walitûkebela lûkûdjagêlo lwê bûkome, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />no nansho twalwegelela kûmona lyese lilya Kabesha Mpûngû lya libabêkêle bantû bage. Kabesha Mpûngû wi mibêkêle lyese lilyo mwigûlû kwana alinyonghoni kûbola, ao koneka ao kuita, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Lilyo likaba lyenyu benywe kwana kwa lwêtabêsho mwaempwa bine bishe kwa bûkome bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, kibalo kya kyalûhandêlo kibalo kwana lwê djambûla kûmoneka nfulo gyakyaba.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Mulogelelwe kibalo kya mwanda gûgo, nanso kwa kyaba kisho kisakimiyenene kûkolelwa kibalo kya bitompibwa ala ala byamulê mukûdjemba. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Bitompanwa bisile kibalo bya kûtompa lwêtabêsho lwenyu. No nolo gine kwana gyakoneka, gyakûtompwa kwakaya. Antû ange no lwêtabêsho lwenyu kwana lwa kitûngo kûlêmba nolo, lûyenene lûtompibwe lûmone kûba lûsoga ao samutambûle ntumbo no bûtûmbê nobûnyeme sigi lilya Yesû Kilisitu alêkaûtûlwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Benywe mwibamukampwe, nanso hamwalimumone, no mwamwitabêsha, nanso hamwalimumone onka. Nansho mwalogelelwa kwamulogo gûlûmbûlûke gûshakûtegeleseke, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Kibalo mwatambûla lûhandêlo lwenyu lwa mutêma, kwana kûkampwa kwalwêtabêsho lwenyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Bamoni baeleleshe no kûlwelekekya kibalo kyalûhandêlo lûlo, balagwêle kibalo kyabûntû bûbo kwana benywe mwaswakûebwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Batompile kûmanya byaba kêê no bûlule kêe bikalongeka bilya bisambile mutêma gwa Kilisitu; kibalo gûgo mutêma gûbele munda gyabo, ûlagwêle masûsû gekamumona Kilistu no ntûmbo gikamulonda. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Kabesha Mpûngû wêbaûtwêle kwana gûlya musahû gwabaelwe hagûbele kibalo kyabo, mone kibalo kyenyu. Gûlya musahû gwamusawelwe no basauli ba mwanda gûsoga kwa bûkome bwa Mutêma Gûlûmbulûke guimine mwigûlû. Gûgo musahû ba masalagûlû bakampilwe kwigûsingûlûla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:12">Lwêto lwa kwêkena ngikeno gilûmbûlûke<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Kwanansho, mube djambûla mbeela no kûkelwa. Mubêke lûkûdjagêlo lwenyu lonse mukyabûntû kilya kyamulê kaebwa kyaba Yesû Kilisitu enekamoneka. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Nagwe baana ba Kabesha Mpûngû bakokele, namuketabêsha mbeela kûlonda ntêma gibê, gya mubele nagyo kyaba kya mubele babidje. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Nambo mwibayenene kûba balûmbûlûke mungêlo gyenyu gyonse, nagwe nansilya gûlya wimitile byalê mulûmbûlûke. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Benlf 11.44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19.2</ref></char></note> Lusinto lwalisamba: “Mube balûmbûlûke kwa kûba nene byandê mulûmbûlûke.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Kibalo mwamwita Tata, gee wakumuwa bûkalabale muntû gense kûlondana no bilongwa byage kûbûla bûkampêlêlwe. Mutambe kwa mwenyo gwa kumwitabêsha Kabesha Mpûngû kyaba kyenyu kya kwêkana ano akandje nagwe baika. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Mwidjê kwana benywe mwandimbwe mungêlo gyenyu gisigiyenene kwana mutambwêle kuima kû batata nkûlû benyu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />nambo kwa masi ga kitûngo ga Kilisitu, wiiminie nagwe mwana mukoko gusi no bûlema no bala. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Gee ûbele musolwelwe no Kabesha Mpûngû mbelê gya kandje kûhangwa, hûû twêlwe masigi gaga ga nfulo kibalo kyenyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kwa ndjêla gyage mwamwitabêsha Kabesha Mpûngû, umushulile kuima kûbaki nokumua ntumbo; nansho lwêtabêsho no lûkûdjagêlo lwenyu lwê kwa Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Mwalimunkya kwa kûkokela sitê, mumone kûkampanwa kwasitê nagwe balûnda. Nfulo mukampanwe benye kwa benye kwa mutêma gûsoga. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû gwalimilonga mubyalwe kûya. No gûlya mwanda hagwe nagwe nindje gya kûkya, kweno bûkome, hagwa kûkya gwa kûgêlêlêla <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isay 40.6-8</ref> </char></note>Ntê lusinto byalûlê lwêsambe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Muntû gense wênagwe maani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">No ntûmbo gyage gyonse ginagwe lûba lwamaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Maani gaûmba, no lûba lwa kûnkûka<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Kûwa mwanda gwa Kolo gûgêlêlêle miaka.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Mwanda gûsoga gwamusawêlwe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kûkûla mu mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Kwanansho muleke bûbê bonse, bumpi, nfika; bûkwa no mianda gya kwambêlêsha nagikabiko byonka, <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />nagwe nansilya baana balûkeke, mube no kiwêwê kya kwikubila mabele gasoga ga mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, kyaba kyamulê mukwikubila shamumone kûkûla no kûhandibwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:8">Ngib 34.8</ref></char></note>Monka mwisambile Lusinto Lûlûmbûlûke: “Mwamona kwana Kolo wabûntû.”<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Nfulo mumugêle Kolo Yesû, gee ûbwe lipoo libengilwe no bantû mone kûgêbwa kwa Kabesha Mpûngû nibwe lisololwe nolia kitûngo kikata. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />No benywe nagwe mabwe gepoo, lekela muimpwe kûba nsese gya kimutêma, no kûba bûlambwili bûlûmbûlûke, kwa kuimia milambû gya kimutêma gitabisibwe mbelê gya Kabesha Mpûngû kwa ndjêla gya Yesû Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isay 28.16</ref> </char></note>Kibalo Lusinto Lûlûmbûlûke lwalisamba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Lola nansolola bwee lya kitûngo lyandê kabêka kû Sayuni nagwe ni bwee lya enfuko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Muntû wêkelitabêsha lilyo bwee hakamona nsoni.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nghib 118.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kwamulê benywe betabêshe, bwee lilyo lyakeminyemia; mone kûbalya basi betabêshe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Bwee lyababengile bahimpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">Ali bwee lya nsulo.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isay 8.14-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Byonka lusinto lwalisamba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Bwe lilyo ni bwee lyakwikukala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">Ntandalwala gya kûgwêsha bantû.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Balikukala kibalo habetabêshe gûlya mwanda; no ûbyo byabahangilwe kûbambêla mubambo. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kuim 19.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isay 43.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Ngib 4.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isay 9.2</ref></char></note>Mone benywe mwimusoo gûsololwe, balambwili ba Kolo, musoo gûlûmbûlûke, bantû bage Kabesha Mpungû mwine, musololwe kûsahûla bilongwa bikata bya Kabesha Mpûngû wimitile kuima mu kidjo, wimitwelishe mumugenge gwage gûkata. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Osey 2.23</ref></char></note>Kala benywe hamubele bantû ba Kabesha Mpûngû, mone ano benywe amwi bantû bage; kala hamumwenwe lûsa kwê Kabesha Mpûngû, mone ano walimimwena lûsa.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bengili ba Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Balûnda bane, na nimisasa benywe omwena bageni, no batini! Hano akandje, mulekele ntêma gya mubêle gyakûlwsêha mutêma. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Mube no lwendo lûsoga mubûkata mwaba shantaila, kûba no habalê kemiambêlêsha kwana mwalonga bibê banyonghone kusingûlûla bilongwa byenyu bisoga nonansho bamutûmbêke Kabesha Mpûngû sigi lya kûsha kwage.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Nfulo mwibêke kû nsê gya kitenta kyonse kya kimuntû, kibalo kya Kolo: mukokele Kolo wêko mubêkali mukûlû, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />no kûba babêkali bamwalo kwana batuminwe kwêbaûla banonga bibê, no kwêbatûmbêka bakûlonga bisoga. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Bilya Kabesha Mpûngû byale mukampwa kwana mulonge biswagale, mumone kûûta tûnya twa babidje, basi bamanya no basi basingûlûle beno maniga gabe ga bûbidje. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Mwikane bi bantû ba bwana abo; mone namukengili bwanaabo bwenyu, kubisika bûbê, nambo mwikane nagwe bengili, ba Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mwibanyemeke bantû bonse, mukampwe balûndanenyu betabêshe, mumutûmbeke Kabesha Mpûngû, mumunyemeke kolo.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lûkêndê lwa masûsû ga Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Benywe bengili bamunsese mwibanyemeke no kwebakokela bakûlû benyu, bale basoga ao babe. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Mone kiyenene kwakûlêndêla masûsû gamusi bayenene, kibalo mwakampwa kumukokela Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ni ntûmbo kêê gya mwakamona kwakûlêndêla masûsû ga bûbe bwenyu? Mone ntê mwalêndêla masûsû gano kibalo mwalonga bisoga, Kabesha Mpûngû wakemia kyabûntû. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Kikyo ukibalo kya mwitilwe, kibalo Kilisitu mwine ûdjembile kibalo kyenyu, wemisigêle lûkendê kûba mulonde ngêlo gyage. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isay 53.9</ref></char></note>Gee halongile bûbê no mwanda gwabûbembani, hagûtegelelwe kûkania kage. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isay 53.7</ref></char></note>Atukilwe gee hebwêlêlêshe malûmbû; hadjembile gee hatûdjwêle, nambo ubikile lûkûdjagêlo lwege, kwê Kabesha Mpûnû, mukalululi wa sitê. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isay 53.5</ref></char></note>Gee mwine ûtwalile bûbê bwetû kumubêlê gwage egûlû lya mutê gwa mpênga mpêtya, tûkye kû bûbê notwêkane musitêê. Kwa kûûlwa kwage betwe twahandibwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isay 53.6</ref></char></note>Benywe mubele nagwe mikoko gisimine, mone byonka mwamwibwêlêla muempi no mulwegeleli wamitêma gyenyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mulûme no mukasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Baef 5.22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Bako 3.18</ref></char>
    </note>No bene benywe baana bakasi, mwibêke ansê gyakitenta kya balûme benyu, kûba nagwe balya baana balûme bonse basibetabêshe mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, bamone kwêtabêsha kwêtêla ngêlo gyenyu. Hakisokûba kiyenene kwamulê kwêsamba mwanda, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kwana bekamona ngêlo gyenyu byagilê gisogo nansilya byamulê bebakokele. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tem 2.9</ref></char></note>Mukwêlengûla kwenyu nakukabi kwa andje, nagwe nansilya muswelo gwa kûotwa nywene, kwêlengûla kwa bintû byanolo, no bishandê bisoga. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Mone, kwêlengûla kwenyu kûbe kwa munda bûsoga busi koneka, bwa mutêma gûkokele, no gwa kwêtûkêsha, kwana kyakitûngo kikata mbelê gya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ûbyo kala baana bakasi byabelêngwêle bamukûjagêle Kabesha Mpûngû bebikile kûnsê gya kitenta kyabalûme babo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Mub 18.12</ref></char></note>Sala kwalûkêndê umukokele Bulaimu; nokumwita gee mulûme wane. Benywe amwibyonka basike bage kwakûlonga bisoga kûbûla kûtûdjûka ntûdjûlo gyogyonse.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Baef 5.25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Bako 3.19</ref></char>
    </note>No byonka nansho no benywe balûme mwikane no bakasi benyu kwa lweni. No kwêbamanya nagwe bantû bakême, mwibalongele kwabûnyeme, kibalo nobo bekatambûla amo nenyu kya bûntû kya bûkome, kyalimiele Kabesha Mpûngû. Benywe kûlonga nansho hakûkabi bikukasi mu milombelo gyenyu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûdjemba kibalo kya kûlonga bisoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Nfulo nanisamba nansino: mwibayenene kûba no mutêma gûmo no maninga gamo; mwibayenene mûkampanwee nagwe balûnda, mube no buntû betûkêshe benywe kwa benywe. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Namukebwêlêlêsha bantû bûbê kwa bûbê; no malûmbû kwa malûmbû, mone mwibesêle malyese, kibalo ûkya mwitilwe mumone kûbêkala malyese. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Nghib 34.12-16</ref> </char></note>Monka mwisambêle lusinto lûlûmbûlûke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Wakûkeba kûlogelelwa ngikeno</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">No kûmona masigi ga ndoge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Esibêle nekesambi bibê,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Elegye kwêsamba bumpi.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Elegye no bûbê alonge bisoga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">Akebe angalê no kwikikwatêsha.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Kwakûba meso ga Kolo gakûlwegelela bantû beno sitê</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">No matwê gage gakûtegelela milombelo gabo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Mone wakwêbaha kinghimba bantû bangonono bibê.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nani wêkanyonghona kwêmiûgenia benywe ntê mwino mukanka gwakûlonga bisoga? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mt 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isay 8.12-13</ref></char></note>Mone ntê kyalimiyenena kûdjemba, kibalo mwakûlonga bisoga, Mwino lyese, namukebatudjuki bantû bobonse, nonamuketabêsha kûbêkwa munganingani. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Mone mumutûmbêke Kilisitu nagwe ni Kolo mumitêma gyenyu, Mube djambûla kumuêndûla gegense. Wêkemibûsha kibalo kyalûkûdjagêlo lwêmunda gyenyu, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />mone mulonge nansho kwabûkokele no bûnyeme. Mube no maninga gasoga, kibalo amwakûtûkwa balya bakwêsamba bibê kibalo kya ngikeno gyenyu gisoga, mwanda mwakwêlûbûlûla nagwe Kilisitu, nobo bekamona nsoni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Kiyenene kûdjemba kibalo kyakûlonga bisoga, nagwe kiswa mutêma gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, kûlêmba kûdjemba kibalo kya kulonga bûbê. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kibalo Kilisitu mwine ûdjembile lûkwe lûmo ya kibalo kya bûbê bwenyu, muntû wêno sitê kibalo kya basi no sitê mwanda ebasishe kwê Kabesha Mpûngû. Wêyagilwe kumubêlê, mone ulongilwe poo kimutêma <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />No kwa bûkome bwa Mutêma gûgo, ûgêle kûsahûla mitêma gibele mu kikûtû. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Mub 6.1—7.24</ref></char></note>Babo ûbobalya babengile kumukokela Kabesha Mpûngû alibaempele kwabûtekabadje masigi galya Noa lwabele wahanga bwatoo. Munda gya bwatoo bûbo bantû basho mpee kwana bantû muganda bahandile lwa madjê, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />kwana kabandêlêlo ka lûbatisho lwa kwimiandia benywe onka. Lûbatisho hamalêngê gakusindûla biiko byamubêlê, mone lwakwêtabêsha lwêto lwa Kabesha Mpûngû lwa kûlongeka maninga gasoga mwibahandie kwa ndjêla gya kûshûka kwa Yesu Kilisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />kwana ûgêle mwigûlû nonka wiki mugela gwakûlûme kwa Kabesha Mpûngû, wabêkala egûlû lya masalagûlû no babêkali bonse no bûkome bwa egûlû.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ngikeno giya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Kibalo Kilisitu ûsûswêlwe mumubêlê, benywe nobo mwibayenene mutambe monka mugalya maninga gage; kibalo wakûsûka mumubêlê wawa kûlekenkana no bûbê, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />kyaba kyenyu kisigele kya kwekana ano akandje, namukagililili kwêkana mu ntêma gya kimuntû, nambo mukiswa mutêma kya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Kyaba kya kala, muitishe kyaba kyenyu kiinge kûlonga bilya bashantaila bya bale mukulonga. Mwagikana ngikeno gya bûseki, ntêma, bûkolwa, ndêlo gibê, lûgosi no kûntota mikisi. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Onkao bashantaila bagalankana lwabalê mukûmona hamwi mubûmo nabo byonka mungikeno gibê, no nansho bakwimitûka. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Mone kibayenene kwabo kwêsahûla mbelê gya Kabesha Mpûngû, wêko ndjambûla kwêbaa bûkalabale bepoo no bakile. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ûkibalo musahû gûsoga gûsawêlwe no kwabalia bakile, bakalêlwe nsambû kûlondana no byabalongile nagwe bantû bonse, mone kwaano kwêtêla Mutêma Gûlûmbûlûke bebwêkana mu ngikeno gya Kabesha Mpûngû.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baempi ba soga ba kyabûntû kya Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Nfulo gya bintû byonse gyashena. Mube no lweni no mukelwe mukûlomba. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Nkd 10.12</ref></char></note>Mbelê gya byonse, mwikampenwe benywe beene kwa beene, kibalo bûkampwe bwa kûhûta bûbê bonse. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mukûnkane benywe kwa benywe akûba no mitompo. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Gûmo wenyu, muyenene kwêngêla kya bûntû kyaelwe no Kabesha Mpûngû kwa katolwa ka baange, nagwe bemeni basoga ba kyabûntû halahala kya Kabesha Mpûngû. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Gûlya wakûsahûla, asahûle mwanda gwa Kabesha Mpûngû; gûlya wakûkwasha muyenene kûkwasha kwa bûkome bwelê muebwe no Kabesha Mpûngû, nansino Kabesha Mpûngû antûmbekwe mû mianda gyonse kwêtêla ndjela gya Yesû Kilistu muyenene ntûmbo no bûkome miaka no miaka! Amina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kûdjemba kikilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Balûnda nane, namukegalagania kibalo kya bitompanwa bikole bya mwakûmona, gagwe nansilya kintû kiya kyalimiikela. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Nambo mulogelelwe kwana mwimubûmo bwa mudjembo gwa Kilisitu, mwanda munyonghone kûba no mulogo kyaba ntûmbo gyage agilê kahûtûlwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Lyese lyenyu, kyaba kyabalê kemitûka kibalo kya sina lya Kilisitu, kibalo mutêma gwa ntûmbo, mutêma gwa Kabesha Mpûngû, gwê egûlû lyenyu. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nakûkabi muntû gegense mubûkata bwenyu wakûdjemba kibalo ni ngyagani, ngibi, ngonono ao wakwêtwesha mu mianda gya bantû. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Mone ntê muntû gee kusûsûka kibalo Mukilisitu, nfulo nekamoni nsoni, nambo amutûmbêke Kabesha Mpûngû, kwa sina lilya.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Kyaba kyashena, bûbo bûkalabale bwabambêla kûbantû ba Kabesha Mpûngû. Kyokûba bûkalabale bûbo, bwabambêla kwetû betwe, nfulogyage kyakaba muswelo kêê kûbalya basi betabêshe mwanda gûsoga gwa Kabesha Mpûngû? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Nkd 11.31</ref> </char></note>Monka mwalûlê lwêsambêle lusinto lûlûmbûlûke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Kyokûba lûûma kûbantû mulûmbûlûke kwandibwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">Kyakaba ntê, nfulo, kûbasibetabêshe Kabesha Mpûngû no beno bûbê?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Kwa nansho balya bakûdjemba, kûlondana no kiswa mutêma kya Kabesha Mpûngû, bagêlêlêle kûlonga bisoga no bebêke mu maboko ga muhangi wabo gee mulûmbûlûke no wasitêê.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kibûngo kya Kabesha Mpûngû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nani mibangêla baleli bemubûkata bwenyu. Nene muleli nenyu. Nsitêkêkye masûsû ga Kilisitu. Byonka nikaba muntumbo gikaimina. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Yoa 21.15-17</ref></char></note>Mwikiempe kilya kibûngo kya Kabesha Mpûngû kyamuelwe, mwikiempe hakwa kûkankamikwa, nambo kwa kiswa mutêma monka mwalê mukampêlwe Kabesha Mpûngû. Mulonge mingêlo gigyo hakwa ntêma gya lûheto, nambo kwa mutêma gwenyu gonse, <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />namukakebi kûbekala kwa buumu kikyo kibungo, kilya kikunsê gya bûlwegeleli bwenyu, nambo mube lûkêndê lwa kikyo kibûngo. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />No kyaba muleli mukûlû enekaimina, benywe mwakatambûla nkata gya ntûmbo, gisi giite.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:34">Nkd 3.34</ref> </char>
    </note>Byonka nansho no benywe basongwa mwibayenene kwêbêka ansê gyakitenta kya baleli benyu. Benywe bonse mwibayenene kûba no kikokesi benywe kwa benywe, mumone kwêngêlana; kibalo lusinto lûlûmbûlûke lwalisamba: “Kabesha Mpûngû ekûnkampwa bantû beno kahûni, mone walibatûngêla kya bûntû betûkêshe.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18.14</ref></char></note>Nfulo, mwitûkêshe benywe bene, kûnsê gya kûboko kwa bûkome bwa Kabesha Mpûngû, kûba emiseshe kyaba kiyenene. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Mumu tûlêle mudjembo genyu gonse , kibalo gee walimitemba.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mube meso, mukelwe! Kibalo mangi gyenyu Lyabola wa kwalagala kwa mulê, omwe na ntambwe gya kukundula, gyakûkeba naani washa tankinye. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Mumwakanie kwa kûba nsûnga mulwêtabêsho, amwamanya kwana balûnda nenyu bonse mukandje bamonwa no mudjembo gonka gûgo. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Mudjembo gwenyu shagûbe gwa kyaba kisho. Mone Kabesha Mpûngû mwitûkampwe mbeela, walimiita mube mubûmo bwantumbo gyage mukûkwatana no Kilisitu. No wêkemilonga balûmbûlûke, beno buumu no kwimimika nsûnga abekemigwêsha byonka. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Bûkome bwêbwêlêle kwage miaka no miaka! Amina.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwimu lwa nfulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Nanimisintêla lûpapûlo lûno lwêhê kwa bûkwasi bwa Silifano, mwanetû mulûmbûlûke, nanonga kibalo kya kwimia mutêma no kusitêkêkya kwana kino ûkyabûntû kya sitê kya Kabesha Mpûngû kyamwa kwatana nakyo.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Bilb 12.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Bako 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Fil 24</ref></char>
    </note> Kiwêlo kikû Babiloni kyalimimuna. Kabesha Mpûngû wê basolwele nagwe benywe, byonka nansilya mwanane Maluko noge walimimuna. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Mwigimunene benywe kwa benywe kwa bûkampwe bwa Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">No talala nyaa libe nenyu benywe bonse bemu Kilisitu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>